73
00:04:15.467 --> 00:04:16.955
Part three: grammar.

74
00:04:17.817 --> 00:04:21.314
Grammar focus: Cause and effect (as a result).

75
00:04:21.614 --> 00:04:22.870
Look at the pattern.

76
00:04:23.583 --> 00:04:26.802
I plan my day, so as a result, I am more productive.

77
00:04:27.717 --> 00:04:31.774
I turned off notifications. As a result, my focus improved.

78
00:04:32.683 --> 00:04:37.182
She uses habit stacking. As a result, she never forgets to read.

79
00:04:38.133 --> 00:04:41.714
'As a result' introduces the effect. Put a comma after it.

80
00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:47.578
Be careful! Don't say: I plan my day. As result, I am more productive.

81
00:04:49.533 --> 00:04:53.498
Say: I plan my day. As a result, I am more productive.

82
00:04:53.798 --> 00:04:55.611
Say 'as a result', with 'a'.

83
00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.901
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

