00:05:20.533 --> 00:05:24.326
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

91
00:05:25.183 --> 00:05:28.799
I turned off my phone. As a blank, I focused better.

92
00:05:29.099 --> 00:05:32.404
A, result. B, reason. C, cause.

93
00:05:35.967 --> 00:05:38.384
The answer is A: result.

94
00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:42.490
Planning set blocks of time for tasks is blank.

95
00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:46.838
A, time-blocking. B, habit stacking. C, workflow.

96
00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.260
The answer is A: time-blocking.

97
00:05:53.417 --> 00:05:56.078
To make something as good as possible is to blank.

98
00:05:56.378 --> 00:06:00.275
A, optimize. B, distract. C, stack.

99
00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:05.821
The answer is A: optimize.

